for revisions suggested by I. Thompson during the NNDC phase1      325 1451
review: MF=6, MT=105 INT: 0-->2; double counting of photons:       325 1451
removed MF=12/14 MT=52 (keeping MF=6 MT=52), removed MF=6 MT=102   325 1451
(keeping MF=12/14 MT=102). -M.W. Paris                             325 1451
                                                                   325 1451
Addendum [2023-04-14]: Reverted MF=3 MT=105 to ENDF/B-VIII.0 std   325 1451
-M.W. Paris                                                        325 1451
                                                                   325 1451
Addendum [2023-06-28]: Reverted MF=4 MT=2 to ENDF/B-VIII.0;        325 1451
for En > 8.0 MeV, according to the note above, MF=4 MT=2 was       325 1451
extrapolated beyond fitted data; testing shows ENDF/B-VIII.0 is    325 1451
preferred. -M.W. Paris                                             325 1451
