                                                                   325 1451
      the 2200 m/s cross sections are as follows:                  325 1451
          mt=1     sigma = 941.6928  barns                         325 1451
          mt=2     sigma = 0.67157   barns                         325 1451
          mt=102   sigma = 0.03850   barns                         325 1451
